WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.280
Verify family visibility. After approved onboarding, the guardian should see only their own linked family and children. Stop if a child is missing or unexpected.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:26.560
Explain daily information. Show the family where the child status and daily updates appear. A blank or not-marked status needs staff review, not an assumption.

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:39.840
Separate access from billing. Being able to sign in does not confirm tuition, saved payment methods, autopay or kiosk readiness. Verify each separately.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:53.120
Support the parent safely. Use the parent invitation and onboarding guides. Never request the parent’s password or card details by ordinary message.

